# OLED55G5WUA, the US 55-inch G5: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W25O).
# The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/): W25O's own hw-option-gen and
# nyx-option-gen (ponytail 33.31.68) decode this line as O24N, US/ATSC, 2.5G OLED, UHD panel,
# 1920x1080 graphics and 120 Hz panel and SoC output. countryGrp 2: configd's USA RMM grpCode.
# ToolOpt: LLS's factory default record of this line, with the G5/55" panelInch and toolType of
# the firmware's factory tables. 2.5G and O24 A0 are VM choices; identity placeholders are
# replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=500200010105102000
ToolOpt=2187535:1310739:1706066:2113:12117555:1647368971
modelName=OLED55G5WUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=O24A0
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
